---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import NewsletterBand from '../components/NewsletterBand.astro';

const schema = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Chris Linsell",
    "jobTitle": "Chief Marketing Officer",
    "worksFor": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "The Mitten Group" },
    "url": "https://chrislinsell.com",
    "description": "Chris Linsell is the Chief Marketing Officer of The Mitten Group and founder of The Playbook RE.",
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "The Playbook RE",
    "url": "https://theplaybookre.com",
    "description": "Strategy and systems for real estate agents who are serious about building a real business.",
    "author": { "@type": "Person", "name": "Chris Linsell" },
  }
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About The Playbook RE — Real Estate Strategy You Can Actually Use"
  description="The Playbook RE exists because the real estate industry deserves better strategy content than what it has. Written by Chris Linsell — CMO, practitioner, and someone who has actually done the work."
  activeNav="about"
  schema={schema}
>
  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-left">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">The Playbook RE</div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">The <em>Playbook</em><br />Exists for<br />a Reason.</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-right">
        <p class="hero-mission">Real estate is one of the most accessible industries in America. The barrier to entry is low by design. The barrier to success is not. That gap is the reason this site exists.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- WHY THIS EXISTS -->
  <div class="why-section">
    <div class="why-inner">
      <div class="why-left">
        <div class="section-label light">Why This Exists</div>
        <h2 class="section-h2">The internet has a real estate content problem.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="why-right">
        <p>Most strategy content for real estate agents is written by people who have never sold a house. It's produced by content studios, staffed by freelancers working from research briefs, or generated by AI systems averaging thousands of sources into something technically correct and practically useless.</p>
        <p>The result is a sea of cookie-cutter advice that <strong>sounds right but doesn't work</strong> — because it was never built from the ground up by someone who's actually done the work.</p>
        <div class="why-callout">
          What professionals actually need isn't a summary of what the industry recommends. They need the full playbook — built from real experience, written with enough depth to actually change how they operate.
        </div>
        <p>That's what The Playbook RE is built to be. Not the most articles. Not the fastest publishing schedule. The most useful resource in the industry, written by someone who has been in the rooms that matter.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ABOUT CHRIS -->
  <div class="chris-section">
    <div class="chris-inner">
      <div class="chris-left">
        <div class="chris-photo">
          <img src="/images/chris-linsell.jpg" alt="Chris Linsell" />
        </div>
        <div class="chris-name">Chris Linsell</div>
        <div class="chris-title">CMO, The Mitten Group</div>
        <div class="chris-socials">
          <div class="social-badge">X</div>
          <div class="social-badge">IN</div>
          <div class="social-badge">IG</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chris-right">
        <p>Chris Linsell is the <strong>Chief Marketing Officer of The Mitten Group</strong>, a residential real estate brokerage in Northern Michigan. He has spent more than a decade working inside real estate businesses — as an agent, strategist, marketer, and builder.</p>
        <p>He has closed transactions personally, managed agent teams, built marketing programs from scratch, and watched every version of the industry's common mistakes play out in real time. The Playbook RE is the resource he wished existed when he was starting out.</p>
        <div class="chris-creds">
          <div class="cred-item">
            <div class="cred-num">10+</div>
            <div class="cred-label">Years in real estate</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cred-item">
            <div class="cred-num">CMO</div>
            <div class="cred-label">The Mitten Group</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cred-item">
            <div class="cred-num">Agent</div>
            <div class="cred-label">Licensed & active</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cred-item">
            <div class="cred-num">Builder</div>
            <div class="cred-label">Teams, systems & strategy</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- WHO IT'S FOR -->
  <div class="for-section">
    <div class="for-inner">
      <div class="section-label">Who It's For</div>
      <h2 class="section-h2">Three kinds of agents read this site.</h2>
      <div class="for-grid">
        <div class="for-card">
          <div class="for-card-tag">New Agent · 0–2 Years</div>
          <h3>The New Agent</h3>
          <p>You have your license and you're working, but you don't have a system yet. You need a foundation that actually holds — one built from how the business actually works, not how the training materials say it works.</p>
          <a href="/start-here/#new-agent" class="for-card-cta">Start here</a>
        </div>
        <div class="for-card">
          <div class="for-card-tag">Established Agent · Producing</div>
          <h3>The Established Agent</h3>
          <p>You're making deals happen, but it's mostly hustle. You want more consistency and less chaos. The playbooks here are about building systems that produce results without requiring everything you have every day.</p>
          <a href="/start-here/#established-agent" class="for-card-cta">Start here</a>
        </div>
        <div class="for-card">
          <div class="for-card-tag">Scaling Agent · Building</div>
          <h3>The Scaling Agent</h3>
          <p>You've built something real and you're trying to figure out how to grow without grinding harder. The next level isn't about doing more — it's about building a business that runs whether you're in the room or not.</p>
          <a href="/start-here/#scaling-agent" class="for-card-cta">Start here</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- EDITORIAL STANDARDS -->
  <div class="editorial-section">
    <div class="editorial-inner">
      <div class="editorial-left">
        <div class="section-label">Editorial Standards</div>
        <h2 class="section-h2">This site has <em>no</em> vendor relationships. Here's what that means.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="editorial-right">
        <p>Every recommendation on this site is based on what we believe is the best tool or approach for the job — not on who's paying for placement. We don't have affiliate relationships. We don't accept sponsored content. We don't let vendor relationships influence editorial decisions.</p>
        <div class="editorial-pledge">
          <p>When we say something works, it's because we've seen it work. When we say something doesn't, same thing. <em>That's the only standard we operate by.</em></p>
        </div>
        <p>This will likely change at some point. When it does, we will disclose it clearly and specifically — at the article level, with exact detail about what the relationship is and what it covers. No buried footnotes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- NEWSLETTER BAND -->
  <NewsletterBand />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero { background: var(--black); }
  .page-hero-inner {
    max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 40px 60px;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: end;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #444; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .hero-title { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 96px; line-height: 0.88; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--white); }
  .hero-title em { color: var(--yellow); font-style: normal; }
  .hero-mission { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.6; color: #777; font-style: italic; max-width: 540px; }

  .why-section { background: var(--off-white); }
  .why-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 400px 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
  .section-h2 { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 52px; line-height: 0.92; letter-spacing: 0.02em; margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--black); }
  .why-right p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--charcoal); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .why-right p strong { color: var(--black); font-weight: 600; }
  .why-callout { border-left: 4px solid var(--yellow); padding: 20px 24px; background: var(--white); margin: 32px 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--charcoal); }

  .chris-section { background: var(--black); }
  .chris-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr; gap: 72px; align-items: start; }
  .chris-left { text-align: center; }
  .chris-photo { width: 220px; height: 220px; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; margin: 0 auto 24px; border: 4px solid var(--yellow); }
  .chris-photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; }
  .chris-name { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .chris-title { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #555; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .chris-socials { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; }
  .social-badge { width: 32px; height: 32px; border: 1px solid #333; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 11px; color: #555; cursor: pointer; }
  .social-badge:hover { border-color: var(--yellow); color: var(--yellow); }
  .chris-right p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: #888; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .chris-right p strong { color: var(--white); font-weight: 600; }
  .chris-creds { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2px; background: #1a1a1a; margin-top: 36px; }
  .cred-item { background: #0d0d0d; padding: 20px 24px; }
  .cred-num { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 36px; color: var(--yellow); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .cred-label { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #555; }

  .for-section { background: var(--off-white); }
  .for-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 40px; }
  .for-inner .section-h2 { margin-top: 16px; }
  .for-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2px; background: var(--rule); margin-top: 36px; }
  .for-card { background: var(--white); padding: 32px; }
  .for-card-tag { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--yellow); background: var(--black); display: inline-block; padding: 3px 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .for-card h3 { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--black); margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1; }
  .for-card p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--charcoal); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .for-card-cta { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--black); text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--yellow); padding-bottom: 2px; }
  .for-card-cta:hover { color: var(--yellow); border-bottom-color: transparent; }

  .editorial-section { background: var(--black); border-top: 4px solid var(--yellow); }
  .editorial-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 400px 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
  .editorial-left .section-h2 { color: var(--white); margin-top: 16px; }
  .editorial-left .section-h2 em { color: var(--yellow); font-style: normal; }
  .editorial-right p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: #777; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .editorial-right p strong { color: var(--white); }
  .editorial-pledge { border-left: 4px solid var(--yellow); padding: 24px 28px; background: #0d0d0d; margin: 32px 0; }
  .editorial-pledge p { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive !important; font-size: 24px !important; line-height: 1.1 !important; color: var(--white) !important; margin-bottom: 0 !important; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  .editorial-pledge p em { color: var(--yellow); font-style: normal; }
</style>
